    "name": "Truth Universally Acknowledged",
    "steam_appid": 2920880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6decb8068b71a37b3003365c0f2f643b.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE ENJOYED FOR ABOUT 5 HOURS</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase Fox's sixth game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth Universally Acknowledged is a Dating Sim game that lets you play as a teenageer named Talay and help him win the heart of 4 different love interests. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new school year comes with a new student, Talay. You are Talay and Talay is you. Help them win the heart of 4 romanceable characters in this whimsical school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic Comedy,  Dating Sim, Visual novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Romanceable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/f8364ab3487c41c1d42d055fe64011cb.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Miy</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very cheerful person with cooking skills that is quite extraordinary. He works as a cook at a cafe located in a sunflower field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/d5a252128d31b9e74ffa38c021679ae4.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Courtney</u></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a bookmaker, magical individual who imbues a book with so much magic through their writing and makes the book comes alive. He is very quiet and tend to keep to himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/c3026a95b796d461c60f3f422af31a09.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Kit</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detective who specialized in treasure hunting. He sometimes forgets to take off his detective hat when he is not on the job. He is also quite shy and awkward individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/c88535c67605c05d5e7090f673ef6548.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>August</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An annoyingly charming a famous celebrity who is mischievous and playful in nature. Because he is famous, the closer you are with him, closer you are to scandal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaction Mechanics</strong><br>In this game you could react to every line of dialogue in the game and the characters will react accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/1ffc8165cc4e9c6549b3a7fb48eff523.avif?t=1748617704\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the stories of the 4 romanceable characters. 32 endings are waiting for you to explore. 8 endings for each of the 4 routes for each romanceable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/abddc47783225f0fe986245a8ab4e5a4.avif?t=1748617704\" width=250 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience short little stories where you will get to learn more about the characters and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/561c3cecc2a9d63cbb2a3a0c42018ff8.avif?t=1748617704\" width=250 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress-Up</strong><br>    Dress Talay up as you wish. While doing that you might also want to fill Talay's confidence bar to maximize the chance of them winning the heart of the romancable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/1b3fa91fc1cc8362230214485416f123.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has 32 endings, 4 for each romanceable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Cgs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6f96b31904e67f8aab4ebb59e8917f22.avif?t=1748617704\" width=400 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------<br><br>Story, Art, Music and Sound Design<br>by ChaseFOX<br><br>Proofread and Developmental Writing<br>by Eskay<br><br>---------------------------------</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6decb8068b71a37b3003365c0f2f643b.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE ENJOYED FOR ABOUT 5 HOURS</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase Fox's sixth game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth Universally Acknowledged is a Dating Sim game that lets you play as a teenageer named Talay and help him win the heart of 4 different love interests. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new school year comes with a new student, Talay. You are Talay and Talay is you. Help them win the heart of 4 romanceable characters in this whimsical school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic Comedy,  Dating Sim, Visual novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Romanceable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/f8364ab3487c41c1d42d055fe64011cb.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Miy</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very cheerful person with cooking skills that is quite extraordinary. He works as a cook at a cafe located in a sunflower field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share