xtras/1ffc8165cc4e9c6549b3a7fb48eff523.avif?t=1748617704\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the stories of the 4 romanceable characters. 32 endings are waiting for you to explore. 8 endings for each of the 4 routes for each romanceable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/abddc47783225f0fe986245a8ab4e5a4.avif?t=1748617704\" width=250 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience short little stories where you will get to learn more about the characters and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/561c3cecc2a9d63cbb2a3a0c42018ff8.avif?t=1748617704\" width=250 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress-Up</strong><br>    Dress Talay up as you wish. While doing that you might also want to fill Talay's confidence bar to maximize the chance of them winning the heart of the romancable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/1b3fa91fc1cc8362230214485416f123.avif?t=1748617704\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has 32 endings, 4 for each romanceable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Cgs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/6f96b31904e67f8aab4ebb59e8917f22.avif?t=1748617704\" width=400 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------<br><br>Story, Art, Music and Sound Design<br>by ChaseFOX<br><br>Proofread and Developmental Writing<br>by Eskay<br><br>---------------------------------</p></li></ul>",
